          "quote_hash": "00357243daae11b86b5c3fe08f9f1863db31515e43035973582d6d144beec208"
        },
        {
          "source_id": "hongshan_seed_ipo",
          "source_url": "https://www.hongshan.com/article/from-seed-to-ipo%EF%BC%8C%E7%BA%A2%E6%9D%89%E7%A7%8D%E5%AD%90%E5%BC%80%E5%A7%8B%E4%BA%A4%E5%8D%B7%E4%BA%86/",
          "source_title": "From seed to IPO，红杉种子开始交卷了｜红杉中国",
          "source_content_hash": "4dced08d726cd51c76416901897b9970f76e9652a9ece39e0dbb3958f127ec41",
          "quote": "自2018年单列以来，红杉种子收获了有史以来第一个IPO。",
          "quote_hash": "cbd5b395e0c32ea1c74fe12dd11336f36e5d014f370272c3888d1000c355bccc"
        },
        {
          "source_id": "hongshan_seed_angel",
          "source_url": "https://www.hongshan.com/article/from-seed-to-ipo%EF%BC%8C%E7%BA%A2%E6%9D%89%E7%A7%8D%E5%AD%90%E5%BC%80%E5%A7%8B%E4%BA%A4%E5%8D%B7%E4%BA%86/",
          "source_title": "From seed to IPO，红杉种子开始交卷了｜剂泰科技案例",
          "source_content_hash": "4dced08d726cd51c76416901897b9970f76e9652a9ece39e0dbb3958f127ec41",
          "quote": "2019年底，红杉种子在天使+轮投资了剂泰，是公司最早的外部投资人之一；六年来，红杉对剂泰连续进行了5轮加持，是支持轮次最多的投资机构，也是上市前持股比例第二大的机构股东。",
          "quote_hash": "487f2bb413e552a50ed27978482393ea3b22b713b3d1cb8b0de0a14049f458a5"
        },
        {
          "source_id": "hongshan_seed_return",
          "source_url": "https://www.hongshan.com/article/from-seed-to-ipo%EF%BC%8C%E7%BA%A2%E6%9D%89%E7%A7%8D%E5%AD%90%E5%BC%80%E5%A7%8B%E4%BA%A4%E5%8D%B7%E4%BA%86/",
          "source_title": "From seed to IPO，红杉种子开始交卷了｜HSG Seed Fund I披露",
          "source_content_hash": "4dced08d726cd51c76416901897b9970f76e9652a9ece39e0dbb3958f127ec41",
          "quote": "这也直接使得剂泰成为红杉种子一期（HSG Seed Fund I）的第一个“全垒打”项目——按照开盘价计算，整支基金将实现回本。",
          "quote_hash": "ca49d780cd72d227b0e11ad910c29ac1620149bf552e740fa4b813b33c406d90"
        },
        {
          "source_id": "hongshan_seed_decision",
          "source_url": "https://www.hongshan.com/article/from-seed-to-ipo%EF%BC%8C%E7%BA%A2%E6%9D%89%E7%A7%8D%E5%AD%90%E5%BC%80%E5%A7%8B%E4%BA%A4%E5%8D%B7%E4%BA%86/",
          "source_title": "From seed to IPO，红杉种子开始交卷了｜早期决策机制",
          "source_content_hash": "4dced08d726cd51c76416901897b9970f76e9652a9ece39e0dbb3958f127ec41",
          "quote": "红杉种子当时刚刚成立一年多，有别于传统的投资流程，而是对极早期项目建立了一个快速决策的特殊机制。",
          "quote_hash": "d708ae6478585e2ddce6dabc9af019af31ff2ece680d3d21830992652a02aa4b"
        },
        {
          "source_id": "hongshan_seed_gong_decision",
          "source_url": "https://www.hongshan.com/article/from-seed-to-ipo%EF%BC%8C%E7%BA%A2%E6%9D%89%E7%A7%8D%E5%AD%90%E5%BC%80%E5%A7%8B%E4%BA%A4%E5%8D%B7%E4%BA%86/",
          "source_title": "From seed to IPO，红杉种子开始交卷了｜公元与剂泰科技",
          "source_content_hash": "4dced08d726cd51c76416901897b9970f76e9652a9ece39e0dbb3958f127ec41",
          "quote": "红杉中国合伙人公元回忆。红杉种子当时刚刚成立一年多，有别于传统的投资流程，而是对极早期项目建立了一个快速决策的特殊机制。公元表示：“和Chris聊完后，我们当场就决定给了TS，这在当时是个no-brainer的决定。”",
          "quote_hash": "750b26e75bd1f35f6f7eed0c563703091b41c2a8c2bfb0da498d0f8beca54ba1"
        },
        {
          "source_id": "hongshan_seed_gu_role",
          "source_url": "https://www.hongshan.com/article/from-seed-to-ipo%EF%BC%8C%E7%BA%A2%E6%9D%89%E7%A7%8D%E5%AD%90%E5%BC%80%E5%A7%8B%E4%BA%A4%E5%8D%B7%E4%BA%86/",
          "source_title": "From seed to IPO，红杉种子开始交卷了｜顾翠萍与剂泰科技",
          "source_content_hash": "4dced08d726cd51c76416901897b9970f76e9652a9ece39e0dbb3958f127ec41",
          "quote": "红杉中国董事总经理顾翠萍是剂泰科技项目的另一位负责人。",
          "quote_hash": "1631c7ad5b081a74713c2c52047e67235087799ec9d7dfbbcc129a1f851d1026"
        },
        {
          "source_id": "hongshan_gu_career",
          "source_url": "https://www.hongshan.com/article/%E7%BA%A2%E6%9D%89%E4%B8%AD%E5%9B%BD%E9%A1%BE%E7%BF%A0%E8%90%8D%EF%BC%9A%E5%A5%BD%E7%9A%84ceo%E7%B3%BB%E7%BB%9F%E7%9A%84%E5%86%B3%E7%AD%96%E6%9C%BA%E5%88%B6%EF%BC%8C%E5%AF%B9%E6%97%A9%E6%9C%9F/",
          "source_title": "红杉中国顾翠萍：好的CEO+系统的决策机制，对早期创业至关重要",
          "source_content_hash": "f60a151d276bcec987999359fa2a1a04f7e01e5e92740f987a4ed8bd6cb616f1",
          "quote": "当时我还在礼来，主要参与一些产品在中国的研发合作、项目引进与管理工作",
          "quote_hash": "fcba710c5f6908de29530a0a05740157ff44c5874f466f835ffde1893c9c5ade"
        },
        {
          "source_id": "hongshan_unitree",
          "source_url": "https://www.hongshan.com/article/%E4%BB%8A%E5%A4%A9%EF%BC%8C%E6%88%91%E4%BB%AC%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%80%E4%BA%86%E6%8A%95%E8%B5%84%E5%AE%87%E6%A0%91%E7%9A%84%E4%B8%80%E9%A1%B5%E7%BA%B8/",
          "source_title": "今天，我们公开了投资宇树的“一页纸”｜红杉中国",
          "source_content_hash": "3d89581e16ff11b9489972e8f3e1f4f81935cabd4615fe5afa1ce02924a213fc",
          "quote": "红杉种子基金在一些非共识方向上的决策流程和投资风格与venture、growth阶段的投资不完全一样",
          "quote_hash": "6d302a4ce674c657c5da5c1041f9b00953868511041d1f3e7b59429a1720cf5c"
        },
